      "id": "comp-kc51ok103",
      "text": "Featuring artists:\n,\nAmy Balkin, Lonny Brooks, The Bureau of Linguistic Reality, Kevin Cooley, Alan Clark, Delta_Ark, Serena Elston, Alicia Escott, David Huffman, Judit Navratil, Tiare Ribeaux, Malik Seneferu, Jody Stillwater, Kytana Winn, and Connie Zheng",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:0.8em; text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Featuring artists: </span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; line-height:0.8em; text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-style:italic;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">,&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"font_8 wixui-rich-text__text\" style=\"font-size:17px; text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Amy Balkin, Lonny Brooks, The Bureau of Linguistic Reality,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size:17px;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Kevin Cooley, Alan Clark, Delta_Ark, Serena Elston, Alicia Escott, David Huffman, Judit Navratil, Tiare Ribeaux, Malik Seneferu, Jody Stillwater, Kytana Winn, and Connie Zheng&nbsp;</span></p>",
      "sha256": "bd3d44b16f492347fa837312eaa8de43c55e5c8b2a639b07d90f228f16f6f0a7"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "comp-kc51ok17",
      "text": "We made a beautiful exhbit\nyou can see from window But we had to cancel scheduled visits",
